> /help
Dosegram keeps track of your medications and reminders.

/start — Create your account and pick a timezone.

/today — Show today's doses and record them.

/meds — Show your medications.

/history — Show the last 7 days.

/taken [medication] — Record the latest dose as taken.

/snooze <minutes> — Snooze the latest dose.

/skip [medication] — Skip the latest dose.

/log [medication] — Log a dose you already took.

/menu — Open the main menu.

/app — Open the app.

/cancel — Cancel the current setup.

/help — Show this help.
> /start
